<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ SEPT NET UP TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ SEPT NET UP TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.10 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.16 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.25 vs   0.46 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    3.30 vs   1.86</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.77 vs   0.16 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.08 vs   0.08 loss</p>
